{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SQUdyUym9vGVV59xDR3XGv","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-016-buFjg2/index.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71ae4abf-37a2-461e-8cc6-a0819a5b3088","uuid":"6d4e0400-6bb1-4553-b9f8-c1ec96d85049","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:30:22.635Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-016-buFjg2/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>Skiff 快速上手</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n  <nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"目录\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">⛵ Skiff <span class=\"ver\">v1.4</span></div>\n    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#intro\">简介</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#install\">1. 安装</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#config\">2. 配置</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#commands\">3. 常用命令</a></li>\n      <li class=\"sub\"><a href=\"#cmd-init\">skiff init</a></li>\n      <li class=\"sub\"><a href=\"#cmd-run\">skiff run</a></li>\n      <li class=\"sub\"><a href=\"#cmd-sync\">skiff sync</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#next\">下一步</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main>\n    <header class=\"hero\" id=\"intro\">\n      <h1>Skiff 快速上手</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Skiff 是一个开源的命令行工具，用一份配置文件管理项目脚手架、任务脚本和远程目录同步。本指南带你在 5 分钟内完成安装、配置，并掌握三个最常用的命令。</p>\n      <div class=\"badges\">\n        <span class=\"badge\">MIT 许可证</span>\n        <span class=\"badge\">macOS / Linux / Windows</span>\n        <span class=\"badge\">单文件二进制，无运行时依赖</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section id=\"install\">\n      <h2><span class=\"step\">第 1 步</span>安装</h2>\n      <p>选择适合你系统的安装方式。所有方式安装的都是同一个独立二进制文件。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n        <button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"brew\">Homebrew</button>\n        <button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"script\">安装脚本</button>\n        <button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"scoop\">Scoop (Windows)</button>\n        <button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"source\">从源码构建</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"brew\">\n        <div class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"p\">$ </span>brew install skiff</pre></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"script\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"p\">$ </span>curl -fsSL https://get.skiff.dev/install.sh | sh</pre></div>\n        <p>脚本默认安装到 <code>~/.local/bin</code>，可通过 <code>SKIFF_INSTALL_DIR</code> 环境变量修改。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"scoop\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"p\">&gt; </span>scoop install skiff</pre></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"source\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"p\">$ </span>git clone https://github.com/skiff-cli/skiff.git\n<span class=\"p\">$ </span>cd skiff\n<span class=\"p\">$ </span>make install</pre></div>\n        <p>需要 Go 1.22 或更高版本。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>安装完成后，验证版本：</p>\n      <div class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"p\">$ </span>skiff --version\n<span class=\"ok\">skiff 1.4.2 (darwin/arm64)</span></pre></div>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">如果提示 <code>command not found</code>，请确认安装目录已加入 <code>PATH</code>，然后重新打开终端。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"config\">\n      <h2><span class=\"step\">第 2 步</span>配置</h2>\n      <p>Skiff 按以下顺序读取配置，后者覆盖前者：</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li>全局配置：<code>~/.config/skiff/config.toml</code></li>\n        <li>项目配置：项目根目录下的 <code>skiff.toml</code></li>\n        <li>环境变量：以 <code>SKIFF_</code> 开头，例如 <code>SKIFF_LOG_LEVEL=debug</code></li>\n        <li>命令行参数：例如 <code>--profile staging</code></li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>最小项目配置</h3>\n      <p>在项目根目录创建 <code>skiff.toml</code>：</p>\n      <div class=\"code\"><div class=\"label\">skiff.toml</div><pre><span class=\"c\"># 项目基本信息</span>\n[project]\nname = \"my-app\"\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 任务：用 skiff run &lt;名称&gt; 执行</span>\n[tasks]\ndev   = \"npm run dev\"\ntest  = \"npm test -- --coverage\"\nbuild = { cmd = \"npm run build\", depends = [\"test\"] }\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 同步目标：用 skiff sync &lt;名称&gt; 执行</span>\n[sync.staging]\nhost    = \"deploy@staging.example.com\"\npath    = \"/srv/my-app\"\ninclude = [\"dist/**\", \"package.json\"]\nexclude = [\"*.map\"]</pre></div>\n\n      <h3>常用配置项</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead><tr><th>配置项</th><th>默认值</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>log_level</code></td><td><code>\"info\"</code></td><td>日志级别：<code>debug</code> / <code>info</code> / <code>warn</code> / <code>error</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>shell</code></td><td>系统默认</td><td>执行任务时使用的 shell，如 <code>\"bash\"</code>、<code>\"pwsh\"</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>parallel</code></td><td><code>4</code></td><td>任务并行执行的最大数量</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>env_file</code></td><td><code>\".env\"</code></td><td>运行任务前自动加载的环境变量文件</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>随时可以检查最终生效的配置：</p>\n      <div class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"p\">$ </span>skiff config show</pre></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"commands\">\n      <h2><span class=\"step\">第 3 步</span>三个常用命令</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"cmd-card\" id=\"cmd-init\">\n        <h3><code>skiff init</code> — 初始化项目</h3>\n        <p>在当前目录生成 <code>skiff.toml</code>，并根据检测到的项目类型（Node、Python、Go 等）预填常用任务。</p>\n        <div class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"p\">$ </span>skiff init\n<span class=\"ok\">✓ 检测到 Node.js 项目 (package.json)</span>\n<span class=\"ok\">✓ 已创建 skiff.toml，包含 3 个任务：dev, test, build</span></pre></div>\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n          <thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>--template &lt;名称&gt;</code></td><td>使用指定模板，如 <code>node</code>、<code>python</code>、<code>blank</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>--force</code></td><td>覆盖已存在的 <code>skiff.toml</code></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"cmd-card\" id=\"cmd-run\">\n        <h3><code>skiff run</code> — 执行任务</h3>\n        <p>运行配置中定义的任务。依赖任务会自动先执行；不带参数时列出所有可用任务。</p>\n        <div class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"p\">$ </span>skiff run build\n<span class=\"c\">▸ test   npm test -- --coverage</span>\n<span class=\"ok\">✓ test   完成 (4.2s)</span>\n<span class=\"c\">▸ build  npm run build</span>\n<span class=\"ok\">✓ build  完成 (11.8s)</span></pre></div>\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n          <thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>--watch</code></td><td>监听文件变化，自动重新执行</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>--no-deps</code></td><td>跳过依赖任务，只执行指定任务</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>-- &lt;参数...&gt;</code></td><td>把后续参数原样传给任务命令，如 <code>skiff run test -- --bail</code></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"cmd-card\" id=\"cmd-sync\">\n        <h3><code>skiff sync</code> — 同步到远程</h3>\n        <p>按 <code>[sync.&lt;名称&gt;]</code> 中的规则，把本地文件增量同步到远程主机（基于 SSH）。</p>\n        <div class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"p\">$ </span>skiff sync staging --dry-run\n<span class=\"c\">将上传 12 个文件 (3.4 MB)，删除 0 个文件</span>\n<span class=\"p\">$ </span>skiff sync staging\n<span class=\"ok\">✓ 已同步到 deploy@staging.example.com:/srv/my-app (2.1s)</span></pre></div>\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n          <thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>--dry-run</code></td><td>只显示将要变更的文件，不实际传输</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>--delete</code></td><td>删除远程存在但本地已不存在的文件</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table></div>\n        <div class=\"note\">首次同步到新目标前，建议先加 <code>--dry-run</code> 确认文件列表，尤其是使用 <code>--delete</code> 时。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"next\">\n      <h2>下一步</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li>运行 <code>skiff help &lt;命令&gt;</code> 查看任意命令的完整参数。</li>\n        <li>运行 <code>skiff completion zsh</code>（或 <code>bash</code> / <code>fish</code> / <code>pwsh</code>）生成 shell 自动补全脚本。</li>\n        <li>遇到问题？用 <code>SKIFF_LOG_LEVEL=debug</code> 重新执行命令，并附上输出提交 Issue。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      Skiff 以 MIT 许可证开源。欢迎提交 Issue 与 Pull Request。\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  // 安装方式标签页切换\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(function (b) {\n        b.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(b === btn));\n      });\n      document.querySelectorAll('.tabpanel').forEach(function (p) {\n        p.hidden = p.dataset.panel !== btn.dataset.tab;\n      });\n    });\n  });\n\n  // 为每个代码块添加复制按钮（只复制命令行，去掉提示符和输出）\n  document.querySelectorAll('.code').forEach(function (block) {\n    var pre = block.querySelector('pre');\n    var btn = document.createElement('button');\n    btn.className = 'copy';\n    btn.type = 'button';\n    btn.textContent = '复制';\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var hasPrompt = pre.querySelector('.p');\n      var text;\n      if (hasPrompt) {\n        text = pre.innerText.split('\\n')\n          .filter(function (l) { return /^[$>] /.test(l); })\n          .map(function (l) { return l.slice(2); })\n          .join('\\n');\n      } else {\n        text = pre.innerText;\n      }\n      var done = function () {\n        btn.textContent = '已复制';\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = '复制'; }, 1500);\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(done, function () { selectText(pre); });\n      } else {\n        selectText(pre);\n      }\n    });\n    block.appendChild(btn);\n  });\n\n  function selectText(el) {\n    var range = document.createRange();\n    range.selectNodeContents(el);\n    var sel = window.getSelection();\n    sel.removeAllRanges();\n    sel.addRange(range);\n  }\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SQUdyUym9vGVV59xDR3XGv","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
